@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.flyleaf
@title Media loading — common Flyleaf preview
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry flyleaf-start
@summary Trace Flyleaf eligibility, opening, stale handling, and viewer commit after successful backend media inspection or mpv fallback.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.publication
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag flyleaf

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[flyleaf-start] Flyleaf preview path <input>
= The common completion router or mpv fallback selected Flyleaf for the current source.
> eligibility

[eligibility] Flyleaf media eligibility <decision>
- Reject audio-only media when the current viewer does not permit audio-only sources @ viewer.PPlayerMediaApply(...)
? "Audio-only source disallowed" > restricted
? "Media allowed" > open

[restricted] Flyleaf restricted-source commit <process>
- Record the restriction and commit the source without usable media information or preview @ viewer.PViewerMediaRecord(...)
  @ viewer.PViewerMediaCommit(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.publication

[open] Flyleaf preview opening <external>
- Create or reuse a Flyleaf player, configure it, apply volume, open the source, pause it, and seek to the start @ viewer.PPlayerMediaApply(...)
  @ viewer.PPlayerFlyleafOpen(...)
  @ viewer.PPlayerStartPause(...)
> open-result

[open-result] Flyleaf opening result <decision>
- Dispose a newly created unattached player if the viewer request became stale during preview opening @ viewer.PPlayerMediaApply(...)
? "Viewer request became stale" > stale
? "Viewer request still current" > commit

[stale] Stale Flyleaf result ignored <output>
= An obsolete Flyleaf result does not replace current viewer state.

[commit] Flyleaf viewer commit <process>
- Record parsed media and preview availability, synchronize the host and media identity, reset nonpersistent crop state, and restore autoplay or stopped state @ viewer.PViewerMediaRecord(...)
  @ viewer.PViewerMediaCommit(...)
> map:functionality.media-loading.common.publication
